const FAQS=[['Is MoveMatch a moving company?','No. MoveMatch is a marketplace that connects you with independent moving companies, brokers and service providers. Every listing states whether the provider is a carrier, a broker or a service partner.'],['Is the cost calculator a quote?','No. The calculator gives an indicative range only. A binding or non-binding estimate comes from the provider after reviewing your inventory and access details.'],['How are providers verified?','Verification is broken into separate checks — identity, business registration, licence (such as USDOT/MC numbers for interstate moves) and insurance. Profiles show exactly which checks are complete; there is no single catch-all badge.'],['What is the difference between binding and non-binding estimates?','A binding estimate fixes the price for the listed items and services. A non-binding estimate may change based on actual weight or time. Every quote on MoveMatch states its estimate type clearly.'],['How much does it cost to use MoveMatch?','Requesting and comparing quotes is free for customers. You pay the provider you book according to their contract.'],['Can I track my move?','Tracking shows booking milestones such as crew assigned, loading, in transit and delivered. Live GPS is only shown where the provider supplies reliable tracking data.'],['What happens if something is damaged?','You can open a claim from your booking. Claims and disputes are reviewed by people and follow the provider\'s valuation coverage terms.'],['How do I join as a moving company?','Use Partner Registration. We collect business, licence and insurance details, and your profile is published only after review.']];
