const STORIES=[['Maya R.','Studio · Chicago → Denver','Comparing three estimates side by side made it obvious which one included packing materials and which didn\'t.'],['Daniel K.','Office · 40 desks','We needed an after-hours move. Filtering for commercial providers saved us days of phone calls.'],['Priya S.','2-bed · Austin local','The inventory builder took ten minutes and every quote came back based on the same list.'],['Tom & Lee','Piano relocation','Seeing insurance details up front gave us real peace of mind for our grand piano.'],['Grace O.','Senior move','My daughter and I could both see the plan, documents and moving-day timeline.']];
